                                "sense_id": "2e30d7cf-c53a-359e-8261-2c0b2f1b5984",
                                "text": "A casement high and triple-arch'd there was, / All garlanded with carven imageries / Of fruits, and flowers, and bunches of knot-grass, / And diamonded with panes of quaint device […]"
                            }
