                                "sense_id": "709411f7-f26c-3fa5-9c0d-42644b04a7e8",
                                "text": "[W]hen in Paris the chief of the police enters a ballroom, so many diamonded pretenders shrink and make themselves as inconspicuous as they can, or give him a supplicating look as they pass."
